  // runtime functions (#2649): asmcore.rt_src_read_line / rt_src_reader_read_chunk
  // / rt_src_reader_close, lowered through the IR pipeline via
  // emit_ir_runtime_fern_fn in the entry block. Their Option and string boxes come
  // from ordinary lowering now, so they carry the rc header at box-8 the
  // hand-written bare-__fern_alloc boxes lacked.
  // __fern_read_file is now a Fern runtime function (#2649): emitted via
  // emit_ir_runtime_fern_fn in the entry block (need-gated on read_file) —
  // returns Result[string, IoError]. openat/lseek/read/close via __syscall3;
  // the sized read buffer becomes the Ok(string). The op_read_file handler
  // calls the stack-ABI __fn___fern_read_file symbol.
  // __fern_write_file is now a Fern runtime function (#2649): emitted via
  // emit_ir_runtime_fern_fn in the entry block (need-gated on write_file) —
  // openat(O_CREAT) via __syscall4 + write/close via __syscall3, returns
  // Result[(), IoError]. The op_write_file handler calls the stack-ABI
  // __fn___fern_write_file symbol.
